// Function:	boxLine()

// Title:	Box Line

// Description:

//		draws a a line of text aligned in the middle of the box

// Programmer:	Paul Bladek

// 

// Date:	10/3/2006

//

// Version:	1.01

// 

// Environment: Hardware: i3 

//              Software: OS: Windows 7; 

