BigNum Tich(BigNum x, BigNum y) //x*y = (10^n * a + b)*(10^n * c+ d) = 10^(2n)*a*c + 10^n *(a*d+b*c) + b*d = 10^(2n)*a*c + 10^n * (a-b)*(d-c) + b*d + 10^n *(a*c+b*d)
